  "title": "China Hosts Historic Peace Talks, but Bars American Journalist From the Room",
  "deck": "As Trump, Xi and Putin discuss nuclear weapons and global security, the exclusion of a Bloomberg reporter raises questions about who controls the public's view of international diplomacy.",
